                        <div class="dics-kb-hero-copy">
                            <h1>
                                Odoo vs SAP:<br/>
                                <span>Which ERP Actually Fits Growing Enterprises?</span>
                            </h1>
                            <div class="dics-kb-lead">
                                <p>
                                    SAP S/4HANA remains the default choice for very large, complex organisations with deep legacy processes. Odoo 18 Enterprise has emerged as the stronger option for high-growth manufacturers, distributors, and multi-entity businesses that need speed, lower total cost of ownership, and genuine flexibility.
                                </p>
                                <p>
                                    This comparison examines real architectural differences — implementation timelines, licensing models, customisation risk, and long-term maintainability — rather than marketing claims.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="dics-kb-byline">
                                <div>
                                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">engineering</span>
                                    <span class="dics-kb-byline__strong">Written by DataInteger ERP Architects</span>
                                </div>
                                <span>•</span>
                                <div>
                                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined">schedule</span>
                                    <span>9 Min Read</span>
                                </div>
                                <span>•</span>
                                <div>
                                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined dics-kb-icon-green">verified</span>
                                    <span class="dics-kb-byline__strong">Verified on Odoo 18 Enterprise</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
