                                    <li>
                                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">info</span>
                                        <span><strong>Ecosystem Size</strong> — Massive partner network and long-term vendor commitment for the largest enterprises.</span>
                                    </li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
