                            <span class="dics-kb-eyebrow">TOTAL COST OF OWNERSHIP</span>
                            <h2 class="h2 fw-bold mb-2">5-Year Cost Reality Check</h2>
                            <p class="text-secondary mb-0">
                                For mid-market and upper mid-market organisations, the cumulative cost difference is usually substantial.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="dics-kb-pillars d-grid gap-3">
                            <article>
                                <span>1</span>
                                <div>
                                    <h3 class="h5 fw-bold mb-2">Licensing</h3>
                                    <p>
                                        Odoo’s all-apps-included model keeps licence spend predictable. SAP’s combination of user types, engines, and indirect access frequently results in higher and less predictable annual costs.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </article>
                            <article>
                                <span>2</span>
                                <div>
                                    <h3 class="h5 fw-bold mb-2">Implementation</h3>
                                    <p>
                                        Odoo implementations are typically a fraction of the cost of equivalent SAP programmes because of shorter timelines and the availability of Python talent.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </article>
                            <article>
                                <span>3</span>
                                <div>
                                    <h3 class="h5 fw-bold mb-2">Ongoing Support &amp; Upgrades</h3>
                                    <p>
                                        Cleaner customisation patterns and a larger developer pool usually translate into lower annual support and upgrade costs with Odoo.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </article>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>


